    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheems Bonk is a casual single-player zone-denial arcade game. Swing your baseball-bat left and right to defeat an endless spawn of Evil Cheems. If Evil Cheems reaches you three times, you lose and Evil Cheems prevails.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite Waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score Tracker</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons Shop - Use Score Points to purchase in-game weapons upgrades and skins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetic Shop - Use Score Points to purchase in-game cosmetics for Cheems and Evil Cheems.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Support and Keymapping</p></li></ul>",
